                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amukazyanye abanyoko, amukazyanye, nkaambo tabeensi mukaangu pe, ambebo nsili mulumyaakwe. Agwisye mavuule aakwe kuzwa kubusyu bwakwe, amamambe aakwe kuzwa kunkolo zyakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
